Package: com.braintimebox.youtubeplus
Name: YouTube Plus
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Hybrid native iOS Share Sheet for YouTube with timecode copy support.
 Replaces YouTube's custom share menu with the native iOS UIActivityViewController
 (system icons: AirDrop, Messages, Copy...) and adds a "Copy link with timecode"
 action bound to the current playback position (&t=Ns).
Maintainer: braintimebox
Author: braintimebox
Homepage: https://github.com/braintimebox/youtube-plus
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate (>= 0.9.5000)
